<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ratnāvalī V.38 — vaemptîness</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111111;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 40rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* One pāda per line. Each is its own block so that on narrow screens a
       hanging indent can mark wrapped text as continuation, not as a new line. */
    .line { display: block; }

    .sanskrit {
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 4.4vw, 1.5rem);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .iast {
      font-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 3vw, 1.0625rem);
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .translation {
      font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 3.6vw, 1.25rem);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .source {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #777777;
    }

    .source a { color: inherit; }

    /* Keep the verse marker from splitting across a wrap. */
    .vnum { white-space: nowrap; }

    .back {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    .back a {
      color: #666666;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: #bbbbbb;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .back a:hover {
      color: #111111;
      text-decoration-color: #111111;
    }

    .back a:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #111111;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    /* Below this width the verse lines wrap. Centred verse cannot survive a
       wrap — it reads as a line break. Set it flush left with a hanging indent
       instead, the standard way to set poetry in a narrow measure. */
    @media (max-width: 42rem) {
      .sanskrit, .iast, .translation { text-align: left; }

      .sanskrit .line,
      .iast .line,
      .translation .line {
        padding-left: 1.5em;
        text-indent: -1.5em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <p class="sanskrit" lang="sa">
      <span class="line">दानाद् भोगः सुखं शीलात्</span>
      <span class="line">क्षान्त्याः कान्तिः श्रमाद् द्युतिः ।</span>
      <span class="line">ध्यानाच् छान्तिर् मतेर् मुक्तिः</span>
      <span class="line">कृपा सर्वार्थसाधनी <span class="vnum">॥३८॥</span></span>
    </p>

    <p class="iast" lang="sa">
      <span class="line">dānād bhogaḥ sukhaṃ śīlāt</span>
      <span class="line">kṣāntyāḥ kāntiḥ śramād dyutiḥ |</span>
      <span class="line">dhyānāc chāntir mater muktiḥ</span>
      <span class="line">kṛpā sarvārthasādhanī <span class="vnum">||38||</span></span>
    </p>

    <p class="translation">
      <span class="line">De la generosidad surge la riqueza; de la disciplina, la felicidad;</span>
      <span class="line">de la paciencia, la belleza; del esfuerzo, el esplendor;</span>
      <span class="line">de la concentración, la paz; de la sabiduría, la liberación;</span>
      <span class="line">de la compasión se realizan todos los fines.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="source">
      Nāgārjuna, <em>Ratnāvalī</em> (<em>Rin chen phreng ba</em>, «La preciosa guirnalda»), capítulo V, verso 38.
      Métrica <em>anuṣṭubh</em>: cuatro <em>pādas</em> de ocho sílabas.<br>
      Sánscrito según la edición crítica de Michael Hahn (1982);
      cotejado en la <a href="http://www2.hf.uio.no/common/apps/permlink/permlink.php?app=polyglotta&amp;context=record&amp;uid=c77f1836-6be6-11df-870c-00215aecadea">Bibliotheca Polyglotta</a>
      de la Universidad de Oslo.
    </p>

    <p class="back"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">← Volver</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
